From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Krishna Chaitanya Chundru <krishna.chundru@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 12:20:09 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 393/394] arm64: dts: qcom: kaanapali: Add t-power-on-us
 property for PCIe root port

Currently the PCIe controller is not programming the T_POWER_ON value,
which can result in improper L1.2 exit behavior. Add the
t-power-on-us property to the PCIe root port so that this value is
correctly programmed during host initialization.

Signed-off-by: Krishna Chaitanya Chundru <krishna.chundru@oss.qualcomm.com>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260911-t_pwr_on-v1-8-c9eee197d082@oss.qualcomm.com

[ from patchwork.kernel.org series 1162606 (patch 14807289, 8 of 8); not applied upstream yet ]
[ only 8/8 (kaanapali) of the series is taken ]
[ upstream author: Krishna Chaitanya Chundru <krishna.chundru@oss.qualcomm.com>; picked for the iceland kernel q89v ]
Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali.dtsi | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali.dtsi
index cd17a037eb3d..82283a7842a5 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali.dtsi
@@ -2724,6 +2724,8 @@ pcie_port0: pcie@0 {
 				#size-cells = <2>;
 				ranges;
 				phys = <&pcie0_phy>;
+
+				t-power-on-us = <80>;
 			};
 		};
 
